<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Holophane rating cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Holophane rating cut.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mesirow Financial analyst Gary Prestopino said he cut his rating on Holophane Corp to market outperform from a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- In a report dated Monday, the analyst said he removed the stock from his focus list based on valuation.</p>
<p>-- His target price for the stock was $22 to $23 a share. The stock closed Monday at $22 and was trading Tuesday down $0.75 at $21.25.</p>
<p>-- Earnings estimates remain $1.60 a share for 1997 and $1.80 a share for 1998.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
